    10 /Helvetica font
    0.15 0.18 0.22 rgb
    40 715 lefttext (The Platform Operator Console is a standalone command surface built for Fizmoh global administrators.)
    40 702 lefttext (Every section is accessible via clean, direct URL paths with full-width responsive layouts and CRUD controls.)
    
    % Feature Block 1: Command Center & Workspaces
    0.98 0.98 0.98 rgb
    40 550 515 135 6 roundrect fill
    0.88 0.90 0.92 rgb
    40 550 515 135 6 roundrect stroke
    
    11 /Helvetica-Bold font
    0.059 0.463 0.431 rgb
    55 665 lefttext (Command Center & Tenant Workspace Governance)
    9 /Helvetica-Bold font
    0.45 0.50 0.55 rgb
    55 650 lefttext (Routes: /platform/command-center, /platform/tenants)
    
    8.5 /Helvetica font
    0.18 0.22 0.28 rgb
    55 632 lefttext (- Real-time Platform KPIs: Active business counts, platform MRR, WhatsApp messages, orders & leads.)
    55 618 lefttext (- Interactive Trend Visualizations: Recharts area & bar charts illustrating message & revenue velocity.)
    55 604 lefttext (- Tenant Lifecycle Management: Provision new workspaces, suspend delinquent accounts, resume services.)
    55 590 lefttext (- Impersonation Gateway: Open and inspect tenant workspace sessions with audit trail tracking.)
    55 576 lefttext (- Unrouted Number Detector: Captures inbound messages from unregistered WhatsApp numbers.)
    55 562 lefttext (- Custom Domain Configuration: Bind dedicated domains (e.g., booking.agency.com) to workspaces.)
    
    % Feature Block 2: Billing, Subscriptions & Invoicing
    0.98 0.98 0.98 rgb
    40 395 515 140 6 roundrect fill
    0.88 0.90 0.92 rgb
    40 395 515 140 6 roundrect stroke
    
    11 /Helvetica-Bold font
    0.059 0.463 0.431 rgb
    55 515 lefttext (Subscriptions, Invoicing & Automated Dunning Engine)
    9 /Helvetica-Bold font
    0.45 0.50 0.55 rgb
    55 500 lefttext (Routes: /platform/billing, /platform/invoices, /platform/revenue)
    
    8.5 /Helvetica font
    0.18 0.22 0.28 rgb
    55 482 lefttext (- Plan Assignment & Modification: Switch tenant plans (Starter, Growth, Enterprise) with instant quota adjustments.)
    55 468 lefttext (- 1-Click Trial Extensions: Extend trial periods by configurable day increments with automatic date recalculation.)
    55 454 lefttext (- Automated Dunning Escalation: Multi-step dunning reminders (1st Reminder -> 2nd Notice -> Final Warning).)
    55 440 lefttext (- Invoice Lifecycle: Track OMR amounts, issue dates, payment gateway IDs, and 1-click 'Mark as Paid' actions.)
    55 426 lefttext (- Financial Intelligence: Live calculation of MRR, ARPU (Average Revenue Per User), and 30-day collections.)
    55 412 lefttext (- Status Badges: Clear visual indicators for ACTIVE, TRIALING, PAST_DUE, CANCELLED subscriptions.)
    
    % Feature Block 3: WhatsApp Number Fleet & Quota Limits
    0.98 0.98 0.98 rgb
    40 240 515 140 6 roundrect fill
    0.88 0.90 0.92 rgb
    40 240 515 140 6 roundrect stroke
    
    11 /Helvetica-Bold font
    0.059 0.463 0.431 rgb
    55 360 lefttext (WhatsApp Number Pool & Resource Quotas)
    9 /Helvetica-Bold font
    0.45 0.50 0.55 rgb
    55 345 lefttext (Routes: /platform/whatsapp-numbers, /platform/usage)
    
    8.5 /Helvetica font
    0.18 0.22 0.28 rgb
    55 327 lefttext (- Meta Cloud API Health Monitor: Real-time quality rating indicators (Green Normal, Yellow Warning, Red Restricted).)
    55 313 lefttext (- Messaging Tier Allocation: Displays tier throughput limits (Tier 1K, Tier 10K, Tier 100K, Unlimited/day).)
    55 299 lefttext (- Number Pool Allocation: Assign phone numbers to dedicated workspaces or hold in unassigned pool.)
    55 285 lefttext (- Resource Quota Matrix: Visual progress bar monitoring per workspace for messages, campaigns, AI tokens & staff.)
    55 271 lefttext (- High-Usage Detection: Workspaces exceeding 90% quota are automatically highlighted with alert badges.)
    55 257 lefttext (- Manual Re-Sync & Diagnostics: Trigger instant health checks against Meta Graph API endpoints.)
    
