    55 628 lefttext (- Threaded Communication View: Complete chronological timeline of customer inquiries and responses.)
    55 614 lefttext (- Private Operator Internal Notes: Internal team notes highlighted in yellow, hidden from tenant view.)
    55 600 lefttext (- Priority & Status Management: Filter and update priority (Low, Medium, High, Urgent) and status.)
    55 586 lefttext (- Staff Assignment: Route tickets to specialized support staff members for rapid SLA resolution.)
    55 572 lefttext (- SLA Metrics: Live count of open, in-progress, waiting, and resolved tickets.)
    
