    55 492 lefttext (- In-App Announcement Banners: Displays top banner alerts across tenant workspace dashboards.)
    55 478 lefttext (- Audience Targeting: Broadcast globally to ALL workspaces or target specific plan tiers (Enterprise/Growth).)
    55 464 lefttext (- Type Classification: Information (Blue), New Feature (Green), Alert (Amber), Maintenance (Dark).)
    55 450 lefttext (- Scheduled Expiry: Automatically schedule start dates and expiry dates for notices.)
    55 436 lefttext (- Full CRUD Suite: Create, edit message text, delete, and 1-click toggle between Published and Draft.)
    55 422 lefttext (- Dynamic Tenant Polling: Tenant workspaces poll /api/announcements/active to render active banners.)
    
