    55 337 lefttext (- Full Audit Trail: Immutable logging of staff actions, impersonations, plan edits, suspensions, and logins.)
    55 323 lefttext (- Multi-Filter & Search: Filter audit history by action type, target entity, or full-text reason search.)
    55 309 lefttext (- Inspect Record Modal: Detailed modal revealing full actor metadata, target scope, and justification.)
    55 295 lefttext (- 1-Click CSV Export: Export filtered audit logs for compliance reviews and SOC2/ISO readiness.)
    55 281 lefttext (- Website Demo & Lead Capture: Ingests inbound leads from /book-demo and /contact pages.)
