    % Section: Security Architecture
    0.98 0.98 0.98 rgb
    40 540 515 155 6 roundrect fill
    0.88 0.90 0.92 rgb
    40 540 515 155 6 roundrect stroke
    
    11 /Helvetica-Bold font
    0.059 0.463 0.431 rgb
    55 675 lefttext (Security Controls & Compliance Architecture)
    
    8.5 /Helvetica font
    0.18 0.22 0.28 rgb
    55 655 lefttext (- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC): Strict segregation between Global Platform Super Admin and)
    55 641 lefttext (  Tenant Staff (Admin, Manager, Agent) enforced via server-side session tokens.)
    55 627 lefttext (- Zero-Knowledge Tenant Impersonation: All operator tenant inspections require explicit reasons)
    55 613 lefttext (  and are immutably logged to the PlatformAuditEvent table.)
    55 599 lefttext (- Webhook Signature Verification: Meta Cloud API and AmwalPay webhooks validated with HMAC-SHA256.)
    55 585 lefttext (- Edge Security & Rate Limiting: Public lead and booking endpoints protected against automated abuse.)
    55 571 lefttext (- Clean Path URL Routing: Modern Next.js dynamic routing (/platform/[section]) replacing fragile hash states.)
    55 557 lefttext (- Defensive Runtime Parsing: Strict Array.isArray guards across all client panels preventing UI crashes.)
    
    % Section: Production Release & Test Suite
    0.98 0.98 0.98 rgb
    40 360 515 165 6 roundrect fill
    0.88 0.90 0.92 rgb
    40 360 515 165 6 roundrect stroke
    
    11 /Helvetica-Bold font
    0.059 0.463 0.431 rgb
    55 505 lefttext (Automated Verification & Release Quality Assurance)
    
    8.5 /Helvetica font
    0.18 0.22 0.28 rgb
    55 485 lefttext (- Comprehensive Unit Test Suite: 74 / 74 unit tests passing (222 test expectations) across 9 test suites.)
    55 471 lefttext (- Full Route Coverage: 185 Next.js application routes compiled and optimized via Turbopack engine.)
    55 457 lefttext (- Automated Service Health Checks: /admin (200 OK), /api/health (200 OK), /api/tours (200 OK).)
    55 443 lefttext (- Live PostgreSQL Migration: Prisma schema synchronized with automated column migrations.)
    55 429 lefttext (- Continuous Deployment Workflow: Production-grade zero-downtime releases with instant rollback support.)
    55 415 lefttext (- Observability: Error boundary monitoring, live delivery webhook retry queues, and latency tracking.)
    55 401 lefttext (- Client-Side State: Zustand persistence store synchronizing theme, active workspace, and staff context.)
    55 387 lefttext (- Cross-Platform Compatibility: Optimized for desktop ultra-wide displays down to mobile viewports.)
    
